#: templates/index.html:1862
msgid "Unlike a standard damage calc,"
msgstr ""

#: templates/index.html:1862
msgid ""
"this calculator runs your move against every spread your opponent "
"actually uses on ladder, weighted by popularity. Instead of guessing one "
