msgstr ""

#: templates/index.html:1863
msgid ""
"Opponent spreads are grouped by outcome — which sets you can OHKO, which "
"need two hits (2HKO), three hits (3HKO), and which survive. Each group "
"shows what percentage of ladder sets fall into that range."
msgstr ""

#: templates/index.html:1864
msgid "Weighted overall:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/index.html:1864
msgid ""
"The final KO chance is averaged across all spreads by usage weight — "
"giving you a single realistic number for how often you'll get the KO on "
"ladder."
msgstr ""

